{
  "schema": "binario-shared-data-v1",
  "description": "The open GTFS-Realtime Trip Updates feeds and the Swiss station boards, the same on Android and on the iPhone: each feed's address, format, timetable pack (bundled, or downloaded at runtime: gate remote-pack, remote-gtfs-v1.json), gate, limits, cache and pause label, how long an observation stays usable, and the limits of the transport.opendata.ch boards. How every source is asked (User-Agent, refusals, breaker) is source-manners-v1.json; the cases both platforms read are contracts/shared-rules/v1/gtfs-realtime-v1.json and swiss-station-board-v1.json.",
